{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KreatureKind is an approachable and wholesome Card Battler/Deck Builder, where you debate monsters to save magic!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Build your team from the seven playable characters (pick Luca if you like a sad emo boy, Riley for killer dance moves). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each has their own strengths and weaknesses, which need to be balanced to win debates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428090/extras/GifFrame.gif?t=1743428996\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even if you're new to this kind of game, you'll figure it out. <br>(It's okay, Quinn isn't much of a gamer either) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Played every card battler on the market? These monsters will still give you a run for your money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428090/extras/GifFrame_2.gif?t=1743428996\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Use your cards to debate monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you don't convince them to join your cause, magic will disappear forever. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No pressure! :3 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428090/extras/GifFrame_1.gif?t=1743428996\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover, unlock, upgrade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features seven playable characters with different focuses, numerous plushies that make them better in discussions, and a whole bunch of cards to build your strategies around. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428090/extras/GifFrame_3.gif?t=1743428996\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Go on campaign</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play though procedurally generated maps and win over each magic faction to your cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're unsuccessful, you have to start over - but only the current map! We're nice like that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428090/extras/GifFrame_4.gif?t=1743428996\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1428090?t=1743428996","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428090/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743428996","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428090/9242caf633a809df1d7341bdea484e911126ce6f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743428996","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428090/9242caf633a809df1d7341bdea484e911126ce6f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743428996","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KreatureKind is an approachable and wholesome Card Battler/Deck Builder, where you debate monsters to save magic!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Build your team from the seven playable characters (pick Luca if you like a sad emo boy, Riley for killer dance moves). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each has their own strengths and weaknesses, which need to be balanced to win debates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p clas